  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Now priced at $3,500,000 - $425,000 below the CV of $3,925,000. Our vendors are focused on a result and encourage buyers to inspect this impressive Orakei family home.\r\n\r\nBeautifully transformed from its solid 1970s origins, the home has been extensively upgraded and thoughtfully reconfigured to deliver superb modern family living. A stylish kitchen, beautifully renovated bathrooms and generous open-plan living combine with an elevated position, excellent sun and harbour and city views.\r\n\r\nOutside is where the property really comes into its own. A large swimming pool with automated solid cover, generous level lawn and expansive entertaining areas create an exceptional setting for children, summer gatherings and relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nThe flexible floorplan provides excellent separation for growing families, teenagers or guests, while two-car garaging, ample off-street parking and covered boat parking add a level of practicality increasingly difficult to find.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a sought-after Orakei location, this is a substantial, beautifully presented family home offering space, sun, views and an outstanding outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWith the price now firmly set at $3,500,000, disregard the CV and online estimates and come through the property to see the value for yourself.",
